<div class="WordSection1"><span style="color:black;">Thanks for letting us know about your missing freight with AWB&nbsp;{{{Case.Freight_AWB_Number__c}}}</span><br />
<br />
<span style="color:black;">An extensive search has been conducted across our network and our operations teams have also reviewed CCTV footage. We've also contacted several customers who had freight on the same flight to rule out any possible processing issues. </span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="color:black;">As we have now exhausted all possible avenues we will close this case. Should there be any further updates, we'll make sure one of our team is in touch. </span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="color:black;">Please accept our sincere apologies for the inconvenience caused. We can provide a letter for you to share with your insurance company.</span><br />
&nbsp;
<div class="WordSection1">
<p>Kind Regards,<br />
<br clear="none" />
<strong>Customer Service</strong><br />
Qantas Freight<br />
<br clear="none" />
Link Road, Mascot NSW 2020<br clear="none" />
P. 13 12 13<br clear="none" />
E. <a href="mailto:freightcustomerservice@qantas.com.au" shape="rect" target="_blank">freightcustomerservice@qantas.com.au</a><br />
